{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/oewIcHhwW2Ql2koyZUDSWQ","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:53:43.614366+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/oewIcHhwW2Ql2koyZUDSWQ","html":"<div><section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/DIslLmBEtt8giaKN3KnQK0msWH6HUJakJsYMEicxTqibRygUkpaD377CVYTXD6D63kloiam3RldJichMw4lQaffES9anAe5zfHAdmRuMRkNVAwxc/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>欢迎报考南京航空航天大学人工智能学院推荐免试研究生！根据学校《2027年接收推荐免试研究生预报名通知》的要求，我院接收推免生预报名工作通知如下。</span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>一、招生类型</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>我院招收</span><span><strong><span>推荐免试攻读硕士学位</span></strong></span><span>研究生和</span><span><strong><span>直接攻读博士学位</span></strong></span><span>研究生(简称“直博生”)。</span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>二、申请基本条件</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>1.中华人民共和国公民。</span></p><p><span>2.拥护中国共产党的领导，遵纪守法，品德良好。</span></p><p><span>3.身体健康状况符合国家和我校规定的体检要求。</span></p><p><span>4.具备研究生培养潜质，具有较强的创新意识、创新能力和专业素养。</span></p><p><span>5.诚实守信，学风端正，不存在任何有违学术道德、专业伦理等行为。</span></p><p><span>6.满足《2027年全国硕士研究生招生工作管理规定》要求的其他条件。</span></p><p><span>7.已取得本科院校推免资格或预计可获得推免资格的学生均可报名；暂未确定是否可获得推免资格的学生可先行报名。</span></p></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>三、申请流程</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>1</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>申请时间</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>研究生报考服务系统开放时间：</span></p><p><span><strong><span>即日起至9月13日</span></strong></span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>2</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>申请方式</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>登录南京航空航天大学研究生报考服务系统，网址：</span></p><p><span><strong><span>http://yzsbm.nuaa.edu.cn/logon</span></strong></span><span>，选择“信息登记管理”，注册并登录系统，填写相关信息，并上传所有申请材料的电子版。</span></p><p><span><strong><span>前期已通过该系统报名参加学院实验室开放日、线上招生宣讲等活动的学生，报名信息自动转为预报名信息（系统相同，账号密码不变），无需重复报名。所有学生如需修改报名信息，须在学院报名截止前联系报考学院退回报名信息，修改完成后重新提交。</span></strong></span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>3</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>电子申请材料提交要求</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>（1）由所在学校院系教务部门加盖公章的本科学习成绩单，成绩单要能反映排名情况；</span></p><p><span>（2）大学英语四级或六级考试成绩单，以及其他能反映英语水平的材料；</span></p><p><span>（3）学术成果（包括公开发表论文、出版著作、获得专利、获得学术科技奖项、承担课题或者其他具有学术水平的成果）；</span></p><p><span>（4）其他各类荣誉、表彰、奖励证书；</span></p><p><span>请将上述全部申请材料电子版按编号顺序合并为一个PDF文档，在报考院系规定时间内通过系统上传提交。</span></p><p><span>申请人提供的材料必须真实。若提交虚假材料或不符合报考条件，一经查实，即取消其拟录取资格、入学资格或学籍，并依据教育部相关规定予以严肃处理，相关责任由申请人自行承担。</span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>4</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>材料审核</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>学院将根据报名情况，对申请人提交的材料进行审核，择优确定综合考核入围人员名单，并</span><span><strong><span>通过学院官网通知入围的申请人参加综合考核，未入围综合考核的申请人不再单独通知</span></strong></span><span><strong><span>。</span></strong></span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>5</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>综合考核</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>学院依据上级政策开展综合考核工作。请申请人根据学院接收推免生工作安排，参加学院组织的综合考核。考核形式以综合面试为主，我校将根据综合考核成绩择优录取。</span></p><p><span><strong><span>具体考核时间、相关工作要求与安排另行通知，请随时关注学院官网后续通知</span></strong></span><span><strong><span>。</span></strong></span></p></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>四、支持政策</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>我校针对录取的推免生实施“创新英才”培养计划，主要内容如下：</span></p><p><span>1.入选推免生可在大四期间提前修读硕士、博士研究生课程，课程成绩合格的，认定为硕士、博士研究生学习阶段学分。</span></p><p><span>2.提前选择导师，优先推荐高水平指导教师，大四阶段提前进入导师科研团队。</span></p><p><span>3.本科毕业设计可选择研究生导师的相关课题。</span></p><p><span>4.本科阶段可申请（主持或参与）各类研究生创新基金项目资助。</span></p><p><span>5.根据相关管理办法，可优先支持参加跨学科协同培养；优先获得出国短期访学项目和国际学术交流基金资助；获得直博资格的研究生，短期访学资助期限可择优延长至6～12个月；直博生优先选拔进入学校研究生拔尖创新人才“引航计划”。</span></p><p><span>6.本培养计划内的硕士研究生，优先推荐硕博连读。</span></p><p><span>7.经导师同意、学院及研究生院审核通过后，可依据相关管理办法申请提前进行研究生学位论文答辩。</span></p><p><span>8.在符合我校招收推免生有关要求的前提下，满足报考专业要求可跨专业报考。</span></p><p><span>9.“创新英才”培养计划须在报名系统中申请，并在考核时与学院进行确认。</span></p></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>五、其他说明</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>1.申请人正式推免志愿填报，须在教育部规定时间段登录“全国推荐免试攻读研究生（免初试、转段）信息公开管理服务系统”（以下简称“推免服务系统”，网址：https://yz.chsi.com.cn/tm），依次完成志愿填报、缴费、复试确认、待录取确认等流程。</span></p><p><span>2.未参加我校预报名的推免生，可在教育部全国推免服务系统开通后直接报名，学院将根据生源及各专业招生计划，决定是否发放复试通知、组织复试考核，具体安排以学院官网通知为准。</span></p><p><span>3.因上级教育主管部门相关文件暂未下达，报名系统中所列的专业信息及相关推免政策可能会有所调整。实际招生专业和研究方向以我校正式发布的2027年招生简章和专业目录为准（预计于2026年9月发布），最终录取专业以教育部推免系统内的待录取确认结果为准。本通知内容若与上级教育主管部门后续印发文件不一致，以上级最新正式文件为准。</span></p></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><strong><span>六、</span></strong><strong><span>联系方式</span></strong></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>联系电话：025-52116010 王老师</span></p><p><span>                               </span></p></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/DIslLmBEttibY2IQkmM5sz20B4CmQEaAl7xibItgVatKPvRYYQxDHbvhNcF5IoeXxiaohEOLymW8omNxyoh37UibreJcCjeic04TPDqztIM6D37k/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><p><span>责任编辑 | 李俊霖、吕陈宸</span></p><p><span>一审 | 杨   耀</span></p><p><span>二审 | 王   香</span></p><p><span>三审 | 朱   旗、杨   一</span></p></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/DIslLmBEtt9u96sKMuTAQ7iaGXY9gODibvBNU38eiakCRpVZSicD0icLflIyaOjzV9ribjyCxfPPlxRjNJUsYJYribWLoUzgD0zcWbGum6met9FdBw/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><span><br/></span></section><p></p></div>","textSha256":"87b8517c8b704853e29f42672c0ceae84baf42330193f5386f8c272d2710218a","textLength":1926,"sourceSha256":"3d7c415e53886ee00571d417801432b0fb04728361129958de79999d5daeb980","selector":"#js_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-733f6df859f1ea62ec9b","title":"2026年南京航空航天大学人工智能学院2027年接收推荐免试研究生预报名通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:53:43.614366+00:00"}
